  - id: D:question/argparse-abbreviation-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/argparse-abbreviation
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "A long option may be given by any prefix that names only one option;
      a prefix naming several is refused as ambiguous."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
      by: move
      from: question
      at: 2026-11-18 12:45:00+00:00
