    state: open
  - id: D:question/argparse-negative-numbers-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/argparse-negative-numbers
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "A word that looks like a negative number (minus then digits, with
      a point allowed) is taken as a value, not an option, while no option looks like one; a word that holds a space
      is always a value."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
      by: move
      from: question
      at: 2026-11-18 12:45:00+00:00
      run: 2026-11-18-1245-a905
    state: open
  - id: D:question/argparse-optional-positional-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/argparse-optional-positional
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "Values are matched to the arguments a run of plain words at a time;
      an optional value (zero or one) is matched in the first run even to nothing, so a plain word after an option
      in between is an unrecognised argument."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
      by: move
      from: question
      at: 2026-11-18 12:45:00+00:00
      run: 2026-11-18-1245-a905
    state: open
  - id: D:question/argparse-subcommands-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/argparse-subcommands
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "A command made of sub-commands takes every word after the sub-command's
      name for that sub-command; a missing sub-command, when required, is reported as a required argument under
      its destination's name; an unknown one is an invalid choice; a first "--" ends the options."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
      by: move
      from: question
      at: 2026-11-18 12:45:00+00:00
      run: 2026-11-18-1245-a905
    state: open
  - id: D:question/environment-read-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/environment-read
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "The environment is a map of names to text, read once when the program
      starts; a name that is not set is absent, which is told apart from one set to the empty text."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
      by: move
      from: question
      at: 2026-11-18 12:45:00+00:00
