    state: open
  - id: D:question/clock-seconds-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/clock-seconds
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "The time now is a fractional number of seconds since 1970-01-01 at
      midnight UTC, with as much precision as the system gives (usually below a microsecond)."
