  - id: D:question/print-line-end-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/print-line-end
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "Printing writes its values separated by one space and ends with one
      line feed, on standard output unless another stream is named; the stream is written in order and flushed when
      the program ends."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
