      run: 2026-11-18-1245-a905
    state: open
  - id: D:question/path-kinds-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/path-kinds
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "A path names a file, a folder, something else, or nothing; a broken
      link names nothing, so asking whether it exists says no; a path under a file names nothing too."
    why: unsure
    kind: text
    to: maker
    raised:
