  - id: D:question/text-decoding-strict-unsure
    type: question
    about: C:reliance/text-decoding-strict
    asks: Is this right, and if not, what is? "Text decoded as UTF-8 refuses the first byte sequence that is not
      valid UTF-8 with a decoding error, a kind of value error, naming the position; a byte-order mark at the start
